{"body": "This changes the default delete granularity for spark 3.5 writes to file scoped. Since synchronous maintenance from #11273  was merged, we should now be able to get the best of both targeted reads and less files on disk. This makes the file scoped deletes more compelling as a default.", "date": "2024-11-05T18:16:55Z", "hash": "sha256:76db8627d8a1061a64d5", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#11478", "meta": {"additions": 33, "base": "main", "closed_at": "2025-01-03T16:40:05Z", "comments": 15, "deletions": 23, "draft": false, "files": ["spark/v3.5/spark-extensions/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/extensions/TestDelete.java", "spark/v3.5/spark-extensions/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/extensions/TestMerge.java", "spark/v3.5/spark-extensions/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/extensions/TestRewritePositionDeleteFilesProcedure.java", "spark/v3.5/spark-extensions/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/extensions/TestUpdate.java", "spark/v3.5/spark/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/SparkWriteConf.java", "spark/v3.5/spark/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/TestSparkWriteConf.java", "spark/v3.5/spark/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/actions/TestRewritePositionDeleteFilesAction.java"], "labels": ["spark", "core"], "merged_at": "2025-01-03T16:40:05Z", "merged_by": "amogh-jahagirdar", "n_files": 7, "number": 11478, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2024-11-06T06:54:06Z", "by": "jbonofre", "state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-08T15:31:19Z", "by": "amogh-jahagirdar", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-11T18:11:17Z", "by": "amogh-jahagirdar", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-12T11:27:05Z", "by": "nastra", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-13T15:42:43Z", "by": "aokolnychyi", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-13T15:47:20Z", "by": "aokolnychyi", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-11-19T14:02:22Z", "by": "amogh-jahagirdar", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2024-12-12T16:12:45Z", "by": "amogh-jahagirdar", "state"