{"body": "Add a new routing mechanism for records that uses Kafka topic name for routing and update configuration for how to route records.\nThe changes move the routing logic to a separate class with different implementations that can be selected via the configuration. It preserves backwards compatibility of current behavior, while adding a way to route records to tables based on the Kafka topic and also allows custom implementations of how records are routed.\nCloses #11163", "date": "2024-11-22T00:47:24Z", "hash": "sha256:01e4fda3f64afdb21014", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#11623", "meta": {"additions": 476, "base": "main", "closed_at": "2026-07-01T00:48:31Z", "closes": [11163], "comments": 41, "deletions": 90, "draft": false, "files": ["docs/docs/kafka-connect.md", "kafka-connect/kafka-connect-runtime/src/integration/java/org/apache/iceberg/connect/TestIntegrationDynamicTable.java", "kafka-connect/kafka-connect-runtime/src/integration/java/org/apache/iceberg/connect/TestIntegrationMultiTable.java", "kafka-connect/kafka-connect-runtime/src/integration/java/org/apache/iceberg/connect/TestIntegrationTopicRouting.java", "kafka-connect/kafka-connect/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/connect/IcebergSinkConfig.java", "kafka-connect/kafka-connect/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/connect/data/RecordRouter.java", "kafka-connect/kafka-connect/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/connect/data/SinkWriter.java", "kafka-connect/kafka-connect/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/connect/data/TestSinkWriter.java"], "labels": ["docs", "stale", "KAFKACONNECT"], "n_files": 8, "number": 11623, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2025-03-26T11:01:03Z", "by": "charlie-haley", "state": "APPROVED"}], "state": "closed", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2026-07-01T00:48:31Z"}, "people": ["mun1r0b0t"], "refs": ["gh:apache/iceberg#11163", "gh:apache/iceberg#11163"], "source": "github", "title": "Kafka Connect: Add mechanisms for routing records by topic name", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/11623"}
